xhs-chaijie-dsh
================

This project is maintained and branded by Longjin as a DSH-native adaptation
and enhancement of ache-chaijie-skill.

Upstream project:
  acheAIsuiyimen/ache-chaijie-skill
  https://github.com/acheAIsuiyimen/ache-chaijie-skill

The upstream MIT copyright and permission notice are retained in LICENSE.
Longjin's modifications include DSH-native discovery and capability routing,
an expanded report contract, a redesigned self-contained report template,
installation and diagnostic scripts, automated validation, examples, and
GitHub presentation assets.

Public-facing product branding belongs to Longjin. This notice does not claim
authorship of the upstream work and must remain with redistributed copies.
